OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of girl and her
OL,4,Aaunt in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has denied murdering
OL,7,Fa seven-year-old girl and her aunt in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire.
OL,10,FNatalie McDonald, 34, and Valentina
OL,11,FFoster died in the blaze in Birchington
OL,12,FAvenue, Grangetown, near Middlesbrough,
OL,13,Fin the early hours of 26 August.
OL,15,FJaden Wright appeared at Teesside Crown
OL,16,FCourt via video link and denied two
OL,17,Fcounts of murder.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
