OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of girl and her
OL,4,Aaunt in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also denied two counts of grievous
OL,7,Fbodily harm with intent and two charges
OL,8,Fof attempted grievous bodily harm with
OL,9,Fintent, relating to the six people in
OL,10,Fthe house at the time. Two adults and
OL,11,Ftwo teenagers were injured in the
OL,12,Fblaze.
